                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "absolutely phenomenal in every aspect, the scares terrified me, the puzzles were fun (coming from someone who hates puzzles), the 4th wall breaking moments were absolutely amazing with the files on your desktop and the ways the game reacts with things you do on your computer. The story is truly great, and the final part of the game is amazing, the true end is absolutely worth getting to.\n\ni ABSOLUTELY recommend IMSCARED, please play it absolutely blind and remember: Think outside of the box and take some time and try to escape.\n\n don't commit suicide and remember that you are loved.",
